    "title": "Chargers Baudler Named to Coach All Star Game - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Chris Varney ,\n1 hours ago (Guthrie Center, IA) — The Iowa Basketball Coaches Association (IBCA) have recently announced that Brad Baudler Head Girls’ Basketball Coach at AC/GC has been selected to coach the 2026 Pizza Ranch IBCA All-Star team. Coach Baudler will be joined by co-coach Richard Wettengel of CB St. Alberts to lead the Southwest team against three other teams from around the state of Iowa.\nThere are four regions in the state of Iowa: NW / NE / SW / SE. Each class selects two coaches and 12 players to represent their class. Four alternate players are also selected in case of conflicts.\nThe games will be held March 28, 2026, at Dallas Center-Grimes High School in Grimes. First-round games kick off at 10:45 am for the girls and 12:00 noon for the boys. Championship and Consolation games will commence at 2:45 pm (Girls) and 4:00 pm (Boys).\nCongratulations to Coach Baudler for this prestigious honor. It is a well-deserved selection and represents his commitment to basketball and to the coaching profession. This selection represents a great opportunity for him to represent his program, school, and community in a great atmosphere coaching many of the state’s finest and most talented basketball players.",
